        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Three peoples fight the same war with the same physics and opposite manners. Choose what you are; the choice is permanent.</p><table><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Soul Reaper</th><th>Hollow</th><th>Quincy</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Buys</strong></td><td>Kid&#333; breadth (six chosen) and the Zanjutsu family</td><td>Hierro, Regeneraci&oacute;n, Sonido</td><td>Reishi weapon, Blut, Sealing</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Pays</strong></td><td>No resistance, no fast healing, baseline Speed</td><td>Two fixed kid&#333; (Cero, Bala); no Zanjutsu</td><td>Two fixed kid&#333; (Heizen, Gritz); no Zanjutsu</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Ladder</strong></td><td>Shikai &rarr; Bankai</td><td>Resurrecci&oacute;n &rarr; Segunda Etapa</td><td>Schrift &rarr; Vollst&auml;ndig</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Plays as</strong></td><td>The generalist: a duelist with answers</td><td>The bruiser: walks in and does not leave</td><td>The controller: denies the enemy their own tricks</td></tr></tbody></table>"
